# Refinement directory — Charlie + HoE collaboration loop per design-system.md §11

Each refinement pass gets its own subdirectory:
  day8-pass1-wire/
  day8-pass2-wire/
  day9-pass1-floor/
  day9-pass2-broadcast/
  ...

Inside each: review.md (committed) + screenshots (gitignored).

The review.md files are committed for posterity — they're the audit trail of
how the design evolved. Screenshots are too large for git; .gitignore excludes
*.png / *.jpg in this subtree.
